{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sect House is a survival horror game with psychological elements and mind-bending puzzles. You play as a child whose once-happy life is shattered after your parents join a sinister cult led by a monstrous pastor. Trapped in a nightmarish home, you must explore shifting environments, solve eerie puzzles, and without falling into the hands of the pastor. Can you escape the house?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711350/extras/add_to_wishlist.png?t=1746179442\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore locations and move along the plot. Look for objects and solve puzzles in the game to move on and escape from the house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Story</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two endings of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Item selection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Various locations</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3711350?t=1746179442","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711350/e729500a752d43a3a12f875b6b07360f57d9fd6c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746179442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711350/53532a9800f36b31c276cd8dd74dff56fc22a0f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746179442","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711350/53532a9800f36b31c276cd8dd74dff56fc22a0f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746179442","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descript